stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> open
    open --> investigating: evidence collected
    investigating --> mitigating: safety gate authorizes
    mitigating --> verifying: typed action completed
    verifying --> resolved: full stability window passed
    open --> escalated: cannot safely investigate
    investigating --> escalated: uncertainty or exhausted budget
    mitigating --> escalated: rejected or failed action
    verifying --> escalated: failed verification or flapping
    resolved --> [*]
    escalated --> [*]
